OL,3,ASix dead and more feared trapped in
OL,4,Acollapsed building in Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least six people are now confirmed
OL,7,Fdead in a residential building collapse
OL,8,Fin the Indian capital, Delhi, with more
OL,9,Fstudents still feared trapped inside.
OL,11,FEyewitnesses told local media that
OL,12,Ftwo-to-four dozen people were inside
OL,13,Fthe five-storey building in the Satya
OL,14,FNiketan neighbourhood of south-west
OL,15,FDelhi when it came down around 13:30
OL,16,Flocal time (08:00 GMT) on Sunday.
OL,18,FAiims hospital confirmed the deaths in
OL,19,Fa statement on Monday. Six others, who
OL,20,Fwere rescued and brought to the
OL,21,Fhospital, are receiving treatment.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
