OL,3,ASix dead and more feared trapped in
OL,4,Acollapsed building in Delhi
OL,5,
OL,6,FDelhi Chief Minister Rekha Gupta said
OL,7,F"accumulation of water, combined with
OL,8,Fongoing repair work in the basement" of
OL,9,Fthe building, Hostel Daze, caused it to
OL,10,Fcollapse.
